Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.50,0:00:55.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《007系列之诺博士》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.89,0:03:17.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（皇后俱乐部 只准会员进入）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.29,0:03:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我有一副好牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it! Hundred honors and 90 below.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.73,0:03:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,做得好 我输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nicely done, Strangways. I have to give it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.43,0:03:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得离开一下 来一巡酒 我请客\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must leave you for a few minutes. Order a round on my chit, porfessor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.64,0:03:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶！你每天非得在这时候停手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it all! Must you break off at this time every evening?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.77,0:03:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, general.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上司习惯每天在这时候打电话找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My director is a creature of habit. I get a call every day at this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.81,0:03:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快回来 别让我们久等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harry back before the cards get cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.95,0:03:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,二十分钟 别乘我离开时做手脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twenty minutes. Don't doctor any hands while I'am away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.45,0:03:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要一样的酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.59,0:03:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bless you, master.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.47,0:04:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, man! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.68,0:04:18.48,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯崔奇威家信箱）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,W6N，W6N，W6N\N{\fnArial\fs30}W6N, W6N, W6N…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.67,0:04:35.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫G7W\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calling G7W.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.34,0:04:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,听到吗？请答话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you hear me? Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.94,0:04:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,G7W 伦敦 G7W 伦敦 我们听到 请答话\N{\fnArial\fs30}G7W, London. G7W, London. Receiving you. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.44,0:04:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好传递讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by to transmit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.25,0:04:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 暂停\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.04,0:05:10.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:25.18,Note,0,0,0,0,,（克拉布岛 诺博士）
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.83,0:05:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,W6N 请答话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, W6N, report my signals. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,W6N 请答话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, W6N. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.91,0:05:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,给讯息部主管 很紧急的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foreman of Signals.Urgent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.75,0:05:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 找MI6无线电安全控制部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Get me MI6 radio security control.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.19,0:06:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.79,0:06:06.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,与京士顿的W6N中断了 中断了还是联络不上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kingston, Jamaica broke contact. Broken of faded?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,是中断 通讯的电波还没截断\N{\fnArial\fs30}Broken. Carrier wave is still established.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.53,0:06:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已检查频道吗？检查了 但没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you check both frequencies? Yes, sir. No joy on eithier.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.64,0:06:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续尝试 联络上后告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep trying. Let me know when they come up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.11,0:06:20.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,W6N请答话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Hello, W6N, report my signals. Over.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.11,0:06:25.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是通讯主管 长官 牙买加中断了通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Foreman of Signals, sir. Jamaica's broken off mid-transmission.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是技术故障\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. It's not a technical fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.82,0:06:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.62,0:06:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会告诉他吗？太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you tell him, sir? Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.09,0:06:37.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（驻伦敦大使）
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你是会员吗？不是 我找詹姆斯邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, are you a member? No, i'm looking for Mr. James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:46.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,请问你贵姓？请你把我的名片给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}What name should I say, sir? Just give him my card, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.14,0:06:49.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,想把外套放在那里吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you like to leave your coat over there, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.50,0:07:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,投注20万\N{\fnArial\fs30}200, 000 à la banque.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟 跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suivi. Suivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.04,0:07:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭牌 揭牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carte. Carte.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.47,0:07:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,7点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sept à la banque.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.47,0:07:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,投注20万\N{\fnArial\fs30}200, 000 à la banque.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.39,0:07:19.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟 也跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suivi. Banco suivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.32,0:07:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭牌 揭牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carte. Carte.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.73,0:07:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,八点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huit à la banque.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.24,0:07:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟 照样跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suivi. C'est suivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.74,0:07:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们会负责支付差额吗？是的 小姐 请换筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}The house will cover the difference? Oui, madame. Changeur, s'il vous plaît.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.50,0:07:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,揭牌 揭牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carte. Carte.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.25,0:07:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点 我还需要换一千元筹码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neuf à la banque. I need another thousand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.27,0:07:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 我很佩服你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your courage, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.50,0:07:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫席维亚特奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trench. Sylvia Trench.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.01,0:07:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我佩服你的运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I admire your luck, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.21,0:08:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.68,0:08:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你介意我把投注限额提高吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, would you care to raise the limit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.45,0:08:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不反对 别这样 小姐 没有必要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no objections. Pas possible, madame. Ce n'estpas légal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:15.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,照样 照样跟，先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now. C'est suivi, monsieur.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.60,0:08:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你想取胜 可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like you're out to get me. It's an idea, at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.60,0:08:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,八 八点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight. Huit à la banque.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.96,0:08:30.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,九点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neuf à la banque.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.58,0:08:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, sir? Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.71,0:08:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andre, I must pass the shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.05,0:08:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,请见谅 那是很重要的事 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you'll forgive me, but it's most important. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:47.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,代我拿去兑换好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have those changed, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这么快离开 实在太可惜了 事情刚开始变得有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too bad you have to go, just as things were getting interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.40,0:09:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 告诉我 特奇小姐 你有什么别的嗜好？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. Tell me, Miss Trench, do you play any other games?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.87,0:09:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是指除了玩扑克牌外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean besides chemin de fer?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.44,0:09:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,高尔夫球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golf, amongst other things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.68,0:09:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那明天下午吧 明天？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Temorrow afternoon, then. Temorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.75,0:09:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着我们还能一起吃晚饭呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could have dinner afterwards, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,听起来很吸引人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds tempting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.66,0:09:21.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明天答覆你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I let you know in the morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.46,0:09:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.13,0:09:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的电话号码在名片上\N{\fnArial\fs30}My number's on the card.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.48,0:09:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,请看看他是否在那里 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See if he's there, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.82,0:09:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你往哪去了？为了找你 我找遍整个伦敦！\N{\fnArial\fs30}James, where on earth have you been? I've been searching London for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.66,0:09:56.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,007来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}007 is here, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.26,0:09:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很快会接见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll see you in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓小姐！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Moneypenny.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.57,0:10:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What gives? Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.17,0:10:04.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我一点鼓励\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given an ounce of encouragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我吃晚饭时 你从不会穿这衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never take me to dinner looking like this, James.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.64,0:10:10.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没带我一起去吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never take me to dinner, period.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.01,0:10:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 但M先生会把我以军法处置\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would, only M would have me court-martialed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,罪名是非法使用国家财物\N{\fnArial\fs30}for illegal ues of goverment property.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.45,0:10:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,讨好我没什么益处 但继续说吧 就现在吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flattery will get you nowhere, but don't stop trying. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.56,0:10:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？关于斯崔奇威的 很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's all this to-do about? Strangways. It's looks serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟牙买加中断联络三小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been burning the air between here and Jamaica for three hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.76,0:10:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}In you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.57,0:10:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘记写信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget to write.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.15,0:10:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.22,0:10:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在凌晨三时了 你什么时候睡觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens to be 3 a.m. When do you sleep, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:10:58.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是在工作时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never on the firm's time, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.29,0:10:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.27,0:11:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚我们跟牙买加中断联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jamaica went off the air tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,在开始程序进行的中途\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right in the middle of the opening procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.77,0:11:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strangways has disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.51,0:11:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的新秘书也是 我们刚派她到那里不久\N{\fnArial\fs30}So has his secretary. She was new. We had just send her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.08,0:11:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威 在进行特别任务吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was strangways on something special?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.15,0:11:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在处理美国人的一个查询\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was checking an inquiry from the Americans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.05,0:11:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们投诉卡纳维尔角火箭 受到干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had complaints about interference with their Cape Canaveral rockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.52,0:11:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们认为干扰来自牙买加地区\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think it comes from the Jamaica area.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.39,0:11:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道「失准」是什么吗？一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does "toppling" mean anything to you? A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.20,0:11:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是利用无线电干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's throwing the gyroscopic controls of a guided missile off balance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.17,0:11:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,导向飞弹的回转仪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a radio beam?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.24,0:11:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}More or less.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,价值五百万 瞄准南大西洋的飞弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five million dollars worth of missile aimed at a spot in the south Atlantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.57,0:11:49.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,落在巴西丛林中 已经很糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but finishing up in the middle of the Brazilian jungle is bad enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.94,0:11:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们想利用火箭 环绕月球飞行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're going to try orbiting a rocket around the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.68,0:11:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国中央情报局派人 跟斯崔奇威一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American CIA sent a man to work with Strangways.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.12,0:12:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫莱特 你认识他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fellow by the name of Leiter. Do you know him?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听过他的名字 但没见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard of him, but never met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.66,0:12:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他找到什么重要线索吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has he found out anything important?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.69,0:12:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问他吧 替你订了七时的机票到京士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask him. You are booked on the 7:00 plane to Kingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.83,0:12:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还有三小时二十二分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That gives you exactly three hours, 22 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.94,0:12:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,军械工匠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Armorer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会把背景资料送到机场给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have background papers sent to you at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.11,0:12:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且放在自我毁灭的袋子内\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a self-destructor bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.38,0:12:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你在飞机上看\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can study them during the flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.38,0:12:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道斯崔奇威 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to know what's happened to Strangways.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,脱下你的外套\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take off your jacket.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.09,0:12:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.60,0:12:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也知道你还是用贝瑞塔 我已经说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought so. Damned Beretta again. I've told you about this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉他 而且是最后一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell him, for the last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.21,0:12:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种手枪很轻巧 适合放在女性的手提包\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nice and light, in a lady's handbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.21,0:12:58.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但威力不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stopping power.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.72,0:13:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么意见？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any comments, 007?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.85,0:13:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不同意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I disagree, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.85,0:13:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用了它十年 不曾失手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've used a Beretta for 10 years. I've never missed with it yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.79,0:13:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,但它在你上次执行任务时卡住 害你受伤住院半年\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it jammed on your last job. You spent six months in hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你编号中的两个0 代表你获授权杀人 不是被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You carry a doubel-0 number. It gives you a license to kill, not get killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.33,0:13:21.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我成为MI6的主管后 死亡率减少了四成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since I've been head of MI6, there's been a 40 percent drop in casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.37,0:13:22.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这情况持续下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want it to stay that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.74,0:13:25.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得改用沃尔特手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll carry the Walther.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.21,0:13:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想离开前线工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you prefer to go back to standard intelligence duties.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.35,0:13:33.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 长官 我不想\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir, I would not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.52,0:13:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你得用别的手枪 给他看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then from now on you carry a different gun. Show him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.09,0:13:39.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是沃尔特PPK\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walther PPK.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.86,0:13:44.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,7点65密耳口径 威力就像砖块穿过玻璃窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 7.65mil, with a delivery like a brick through a plate-glass window.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.86,0:13:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,装上消音器后 只是些微减低射击速度\N{\fnArial\fs30}Takes a Brausch silencer with very little reduction in muzzle velocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国中情局的人也使用它 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American CIA swear by them. Thank you, Major Boothroyd.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.20,0:13:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir. Good night, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.17,0:13:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么问题 007？没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions, 007? No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.47,0:13:58.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,007？是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}007? Sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.72,0:14:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下贝瑞塔手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just leave the Beretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.34,0:14:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱班霓小姐 别跟007寒喧 他赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Moneypenny, forget the usual repartee. 007's in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.82,0:14:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.96,0:15:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 你让我打不中\N{\fnArial\fs30}There! You made me miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.34,0:15:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有错过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't miss a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎样进来的？算了 反正你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get in? Never mind. You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.04,0:15:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我决定接受你的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I decided to accept your invitation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.51,0:15:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,该是明天下午见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for tomorrow afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.41,0:15:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常穿这样打高尔夫球吗？我只是换些舒适的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always dress this way for golf? I changed into something comfortabel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.78,0:15:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望我没做错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope I did the right thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.05,0:15:52.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没做错 只是选择了错误的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did the right thing, but you picked the wrong moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.66,0:15:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得立刻离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to leave immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.26,0:15:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.63,0:16:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情刚开始变得有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just as things were getting interesting again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.14,0:16:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你何时要离开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When did you say you had to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.81,0:16:11.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.45,0:16:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.29,0:16:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约 泛美航机 已到达牙买加京士顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, New York. Your Pan Am 323 just landed in Kingston, Jamaica.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.52,0:17:00.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车 计程车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi! Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.49,0:17:02.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.53,0:17:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.00,0:17:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车 你是邦德先生吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi! Mr.Bond, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.30,0:17:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.57,0:17:13.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫琼斯 是政府派来的司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Mr.Jones. Chauffeur from Government House.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.67,0:17:18.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的行李留在饭店 我去查看订房记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, we'll drop my bags at the hotel. I want to check my reservation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.94,0:17:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧 不 你只需看管行李\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do that. No. You just take care of the bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.70,0:17:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府总部吗？是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Government House? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.97,0:17:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想找秘书长 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Principal secretary, please. Hold the line, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.31,0:17:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁找他？环球出口的詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants him? James Bond. Universal Exports.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.05,0:17:57.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到牙买加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Jamaica, Mr.Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.75,0:18:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的部门今早通知了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, your head office alerted us this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起吃午餐好吗？一点如何？好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Free for lunch today? One o'clock? That'll suit me fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.02,0:18:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有派人来接我吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, have you sent a car for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.26,0:18:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得你想有 正式的接待仪式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't think you wanted an official reception.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.96,0:18:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 一点见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite right. One o'clock then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.37,0:18:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我迟到几分钟 请见谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me if I'm a few minutes late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.29,0:18:36.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想先到哪里？政府总部 但不用急\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to first, sir? Government House, but no hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.02,0:18:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去观光吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just take me for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:13.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常开快车吗？我说过不用急\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always drive this fast? I told you I wasn't in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.33,0:19:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我想我们被人跟踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sir, but I think there's some fellow trying to follow us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.27,0:19:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我建议你尝试摆脱他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I suggest you try and lose them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,在下一个转弯右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the next right turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.65,0:20:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在你的朋友来到前 快招认一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Mr.Jones, talk fast before your friend doubles back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.35,0:20:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你替谁工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.85,0:20:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么 我被委派到机场迎接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're saying. I was sent to meet you at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.66,0:20:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁委派你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}By whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.43,0:20:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,政府总部\N{\fnArial\fs30}By Government House.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.40,0:20:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:24.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,把双手放在方向盘上 我是个没什么耐性的乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both hands on the wheel! I'm a nervous passenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.97,0:20:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out. Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.54,0:20:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的手放在我能看见的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep your hands where I can see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.87,0:20:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.05,0:21:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从实招来 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now talk. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我吸一口烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me have a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}To hell with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.50,0:22:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 别让他离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant, make sure he doesn't get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.54,0:22:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,香烟中加入氰化物？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cyanide in a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.31,0:22:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很厉害 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fantastic. No less.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:15.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么线索？那是一辆赃车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Duff, what have you got? The car was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.91,0:22:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还没认出司机是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't identified the driver yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.02,0:22:20.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他一定不是京士顿人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he wasn't a Kingston man.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.18,0:22:24.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管他来自哪儿 我抵达的消息已经泄露了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever ha was from, news of my arrival leaked.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.22,0:22:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定不是我们泄露的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't advertise it, I can assure you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.69,0:22:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps not.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.46,0:22:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来有人在出售门票\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed someone had been selling tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.73,0:22:33.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我们能效劳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything more we can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.13,0:22:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见最后跟斯崔奇威 一起的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to meet the last people to see Strangways.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.94,0:22:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跟玩桥牌的四个人道别后 没有人见过他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody saw him after he left our bridge four at the Queens Club.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.71,0:22:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是谁？登特教授\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who were the others? Professor Dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.74,0:22:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是受人尊重的冶金学家 开设了一家实验室 背景清白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Metallurgist. Runs a test laboratory. Respected. Clean bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.68,0:22:50.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,波特 前陆军上将 来这儿多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Potter. General, ex-army. Been here ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.72,0:22:52.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,先调查他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with those.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,要把他们带来问话吗？不 我会私底下见他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want them brought in? Lord, no! I'll meet them socially.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.75,0:22:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚在俱乐部 我介绍他们给你认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll introduce you at the club tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.76,0:23:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我想看看斯崔奇威的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. I'd like to take a look at Strangways' place.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.86,0:23:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在带你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll run you up there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.47,0:23:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.82,0:23:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 那里有血迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes, that's a blood patch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说血型是ORh阳性 是她的血型\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've grouped it as O-Rh positive. That's her group, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.77,0:23:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到时通讯机还在运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The set was still switched on when we came round.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.80,0:23:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们曾尝试用那频道通讯 但没有反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}We tried to get through on that frequency, but it was dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.97,0:23:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,以后也不会有反应 保安系统 被破坏后 所有频道都会更改\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it'll stay dead. All frequencies are changed when security's broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.91,0:23:55.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地形结构 东加勒比海）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.52,0:24:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,是登特实验室的收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Receipt from Dent Laboratories.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.02,0:24:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威爱研究地质学吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Geology a hobby of Strangways'?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.46,0:24:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I know of, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.83,0:24:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟斯崔奇威一起的是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is the man with Strangways?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.84,0:24:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地渔民\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the local fishermen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.61,0:24:24.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚才跟踪我 是吗？这可能是线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}He drove the car that tailed me. That so? That gives us something.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.54,0:24:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会调查他 就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have a check made on him. You do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.45,0:24:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,到俱乐部前我想先洗澡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to have a bath before I meet Pleydell-Smith at the club.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.32,0:24:41.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吩咐的伏特加混合马丁尼 没有搅拌\N{\fnArial\fs30}One medium-dry vodka martini, mixed like you said, sir, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.00,0:24:43.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有什么吩咐吗？没有了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else? No, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.03,0:24:45.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.61,0:26:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威就这样消失了 真奇怪 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Curious, old Strangways just vanishing like that. Or is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.65,0:26:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的秘书很友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}His secretary was very nice, very nice indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.32,0:26:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识她吗？我见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you know her? I'd seen her around, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.42,0:26:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都不知道 究竟发生什么事吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose none of you could throw any light on what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.56,0:26:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说过什么？有没有露什么口风？\N{\fnArial\fs30}His conversation? Any hint?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.86,0:26:26.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只说关于钓鱼和桥牌的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never heard him talk about anything but big-game fishing and bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.57,0:26:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,三周前他开始每天都去钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He started fishing three weeks ago and was out practically every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.91,0:26:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他因此付出代价 渔民都跟地球公司租船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must've cost him something. These fishermen ask the Earth to charter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.91,0:26:39.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸勒尔的价钱最高 夸勒尔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Quarrel's the most expensive. Quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.32,0:26:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是开曼群岛的人 在海港有一艘船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cayman Islander. Keeps a boat in the harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.82,0:26:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.43,0:26:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 夸勒尔在哪？他在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Where do I find Quarrel? Him.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.13,0:26:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.48,0:27:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是夸勒尔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your name Quarrel?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.41,0:27:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.92,0:27:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是斯崔奇威指挥官的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a friend of Commander Strangways.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.06,0:27:23.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,很棒 我爱认识朋友的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't that nice! I like people who's friends of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.53,0:27:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你或许知道他发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you might be able to tell me what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.43,0:27:30.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,以我所知 没有事发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as I know, nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.13,0:27:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你知道事情的另一个版本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you know different, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.90,0:27:38.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用船带他到哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you take him in your boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.57,0:27:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.48,0:27:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里是加勒比海\N{\fnArial\fs30}That there's the Caribbean.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.25,0:27:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带他到那里钓鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where. Fishing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.08,0:27:49.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢钓鱼 我想租用你的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm interested in fishing. I'd like to charter your boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.09,0:27:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我的船不租给别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. It's not for hire.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.36,0:27:56.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我找错人了 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seems I came to the wrong address. That's all rigth.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.63,0:28:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不介意 我有事要办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if you'll excuse me, I've got business to attend to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.40,0:28:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,普斯费勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Puss Feller.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.59,0:29:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是我的朋友弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if it ain't my friend what gets addresses mixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.29,0:29:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你喜欢美味的食物 你就没有弄错\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the right one now if you like good eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.99,0:29:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,若谈话内容配合 我会喜欢美食\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do if the conversation matches it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.86,0:29:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,回到船只那儿 这里太多人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back at the boat, too public.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.63,0:29:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去就不一样了 我跟你\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there, it different. After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.74,0:29:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.58,0:29:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我们单独聊聊 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}See we get a bit of privacy. Nothing but.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.35,0:29:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing but.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.12,0:29:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick a seat. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.86,0:29:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你想谈什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, mister, supposing you start the conversation. How's about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.98,0:29:54.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挣扎了 普斯费勒可以跟鳄鱼摔角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't no use struggling. Puss Feller wrestles alligators.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.35,0:30:05.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 慢慢站起来 面向墙壁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right! Up slowly and face that wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.57,0:30:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.41,0:30:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松一点 别紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gently, gently. Let's not get excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.68,0:30:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,替他搜身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frisk him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.03,0:30:45.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,没发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.10,0:30:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣 你怎会来这里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Interesting. Where were you measured for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.20,0:30:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的裁缝萨维露告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}My tailor. Savile Row.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.24,0:30:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？我的消息来自华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That so? Mine's a guy in Washington.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.67,0:30:58.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,中央情报局的菲力斯莱特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Felix Leiter, Central Intelligence Agency.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.88,0:31:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是詹姆斯邦德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be James Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.51,0:31:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们站在同一阵线吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean we've fighting the same war?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.18,0:31:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在机场看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I spotted you at the airport.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.42,0:31:09.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你上敌人的车时 我想自己一定弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I saw you drive off with the opposition, I figured I must be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.72,0:31:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸勒尔是我的助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quarrel's been helping me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.36,0:31:14.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不会很难受 手有点痛 很高兴认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hard feelings, I hope. Only a sore hand. Glad to know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.93,0:31:16.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是这里的主人普斯费勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Puss Feller. He owns the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.96,0:31:19.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望他的厨艺比身手好 你试试吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope he cooks better than he fights. You could find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.50,0:31:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还没有人吃过我的食物后死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody died from my cooking yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.72,0:31:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 轻轻松松跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ It's so easy to jump up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.69,0:31:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 漂亮女孩走了过来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Take a pretty girl, take a whirl ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.60,0:31:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 挥舞着手跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ And then do it again, again jump up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.56,0:31:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 搂紧了她跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Hold her very tight, then for all the night ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.44,0:31:35.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jump up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.36,0:31:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 跳起来 跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jump up, jump up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.03,0:31:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 牙买加 跳起来 跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jamaica jump up, jump up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.90,0:31:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 牙买加 跳起来 唱起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jamaica jump-up music ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.95,0:31:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 欢乐永远在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jamaica never want to stop jump-up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.41,0:31:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 跳起来 跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jump up, jump up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.16,0:31:46.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 牙买加 跳起来 跳起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jamaica jump up, jump up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.95,0:31:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 牙买加 跳起来 唱起来 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jamaica jump-up music ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.12,0:31:51.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 欢乐永远在 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Jamaica never want to stop jump-up ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.04,0:32:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样的 卡纳维尔角的人很着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you are. Cape Canaveral is screaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.94,0:32:05.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不想登陆月球的计划 有任何差错\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't want anything to go wrong with this moon-rocket launching.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.58,0:32:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说斯崔奇威认为 干扰不是来自这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say Strangways didn't think the Interference was coming from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.28,0:32:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该已经有点头绪 我曾非正式地调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose you cased the joint. I checked unofficially.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.19,0:32:17.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们英国人对于越境的事 真的很敏感\N{\fnArial\fs30}You limeys can be pretty touchy about trespassing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.63,0:32:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威和夸勒尔 调查了附近的岛屿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strangways and Quarrel checked the offshore islands.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.09,0:32:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发现吗？没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found nothing? Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.10,0:32:25.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们到了哪些地方？几乎所有地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you look? Just about most everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.53,0:32:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,火焰岛、克拉布岛和摩根暗礁 全都彻底调查过吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire Island, Crab Key, Morgan's Reef. Checked them all thoroughly?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.60,0:32:32.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了克拉布岛 我们不能进入那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except Crab Key. We have no right to go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.51,0:32:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？那地方属于一个中国人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not? It belongs to a Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸勒尔 抓住她和她的相机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her, Quarrel, and the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.82,0:32:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evening, missus.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.96,0:32:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄痛我了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurting!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.86,0:32:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长想你跟我们一起喝酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain wants you to have a drink with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.90,0:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弄痛我了 你不是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're hurting me. You can't mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.21,0:33:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.25,0:33:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么想为我拍照？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want another picture of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.35,0:33:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,在机场时我只拍了你的帽子 快叫这猿人放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only got your hat at the airport. Tell this ape to let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.66,0:33:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何要替我拍照？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want a picture?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.72,0:33:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以此维生 谁聘请你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way I earn my living. Who pays you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.86,0:33:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林纳日报\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Daily Gleaner.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.30,0:33:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么我能帮忙？你见过这女孩吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything I can do? Ever seen this girl before?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.47,0:33:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,她有时会来这里 她骚扰你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She comes here sometimes. She being a nuisance to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.04,0:33:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我赶走她吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to get rid of her?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.65,0:33:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话到格林纳日报 问他们今晚有否派摄影师来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Ring the Gleaner and find out if they sent a photographer her toningt.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.35,0:33:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们没派我来 我是自由摄影师\N{\fnArial\fs30}They didn't send me. I work freelance.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.55,0:33:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？你为谁工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freelance? For whom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.29,0:33:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.69,0:34:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,从实招来后他就会停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell us and he'll stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.60,0:34:10.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,她什么也不肯说 要我弄断她的手吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't get nothing out of her. Want me to break her arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.17,0:34:13.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.41,0:34:21.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,下不为例 放开她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The second time nothing's come out. Give her her arm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.85,0:34:25.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 自由摄影师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run along, freelance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.29,0:34:29.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会后悔的！你们会后悔的 混球！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll be sorry! You'll all be sorry, you rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.60,0:34:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,一人宁可服毒 另一人宁可手被弄断\N{\fnArial\fs30}One takes cyanide, another would have let her arm be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.47,0:34:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个都不肯招供 他们为何那么害怕？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither would talk. Who puts that sort of scare into people?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.54,0:34:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们最好尽快查出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We better find out but fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.71,0:34:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,克拉布岛有什么特别？为何我们不能到那里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so special about Crab Key? Why can't we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.54,0:34:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿属于一个中国人的 他不让任何人进入\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to a Chinese character. He won't allow anyone to land.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.85,0:34:53.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾派侦察艇视察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had our naval reconnaissance planes tak a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.92,0:34:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只找到铝土矿和\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found nothing but a bauxite mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.25,0:34:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷达装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}low-scan C-H radar setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.72,0:35:00.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些东西不违法\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's nothing illegal about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.49,0:35:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很害怕到克拉布岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Crab Key scares me plenty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.73,0:35:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的朋友到那里找贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Friends of mine went there after seashells.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.80,0:35:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但却遇上麻烦 再没有回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only trouble, they never came back again.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.27,0:35:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,本地的渔民都不会到那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of the local fishermen will go there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.87,0:35:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威指挥官和我 在晚上潜入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Strangways and me slipped in at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.27,0:35:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿了样本后 我们就离开 别再到那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He take samples and we came back. Don't do to hang about there.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.07,0:35:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样本？一些石块、沙和海水\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of samples? Bits of rock, sand, water.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.48,0:35:28.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,原来这样 我开始对 克拉布岛产生兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see. Crab Key begins to interest me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.15,0:35:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对那中国人 还有什么认识？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do we know about this Chinese gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.82,0:35:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 只知道他的名字叫诺博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing much, except his name. Dr.No.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.73,0:36:10.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（登特教授办公室询问处）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.63,0:36:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见登特教授 你有预约吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to see Professor Dent. Have you an appointment, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.37,0:36:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他是昨天认识的 詹姆斯邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him it's James Bond. We met yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.04,0:36:20.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 他在实验室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well. He's somewhere in the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.64,0:36:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,登特教授在吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Professor Dent there?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.21,0:36:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.75,0:36:30.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授 早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.12,0:36:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么能为你效劳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr.Bond. Anything I can do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.75,0:36:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到过斯崔奇威的办公室 他有你的收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I came across this in Strangways' office. Your receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.09,0:36:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你能告诉我是怎么一回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's right. Can you tell me anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.17,0:36:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威是个可怜的 业余地质学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Poor old Strangways. Bit of a bug of his, this amateur geology.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.87,0:36:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把石块样本拿来化验 说它们很有价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}He brought rock samples in for testing, convinced they were valuable.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.94,0:36:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were they?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.98,0:36:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 那些只是低价的黄铁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, of course not. Just low-grade iron pyrites.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.25,0:37:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让我看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.25,0:37:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我把它们扔掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I threw them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.22,0:37:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他在哪里找到它们吗？不 他没有说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where he found them? No, he didn't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.59,0:37:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是克拉布岛吗？肯定不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crab Key, perhaps? Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.69,0:37:15.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何这么肯定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why so certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.83,0:37:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在地质学上是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not geologically possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.03,0:37:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 感谢你与我谈了这么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much. It's kind of you to spare me your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.80,0:37:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're very welcome, Mr.Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.97,0:37:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,教授？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.68,0:37:30.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,请还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.22,0:37:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.44,0:37:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得到克拉布岛 你知道程序吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got to get to Crab Key. You know the procedure.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.71,0:38:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了 我会负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time for that. I'll take responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.51,0:38:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你知道自己在做什么 走吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you know what you're doing. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.02,0:38:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发了电报 他们在等我 去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I radioed. They're expecting me. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.54,0:39:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.35,0:39:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你不遵照我的规定 在白天来见我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why have you disobeyed my strictest rule and come in daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.82,0:39:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定要这样做 今早邦德来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to. Bond came to see me this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.26,0:40:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我下令要杀死他 为何他还活着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I gave orders that he should be killde. Why is he still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.37,0:40:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的任务失败了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our attempts failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.23,0:40:06.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的任务失败了 我不喜欢失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your attempts failed, I do not like failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.84,0:40:09.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会再让我失望吧 教授？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not going to fail me again, professor?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.54,0:40:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会 我是来警告你\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I came to warn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.71,0:40:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,警告我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warn me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.48,0:40:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.31,0:40:19.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德发现斯崔奇威 从克拉布岛取得石头样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bond discovered those rock samples of Strangways' came from Crab Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.15,0:40:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是傻子 他很快会到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a fool. He's sure to come out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.65,0:40:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不是 若他来了 你要负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope not. If he does, I shall hold you responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.72,0:40:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I make myself clear?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, quite clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.33,0:40:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,到桌子旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go to the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.74,0:40:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到笼子内有什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what is in the cage?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.12,0:40:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它拿起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.92,0:40:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.93,0:41:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.35,0:41:26.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想发电报 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to send a cable. Yes, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.15,0:41:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你订的车子已送来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The car you ordered, it's been delivered.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.79,0:41:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,在五号停车场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in number five parking lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.93,0:41:37.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 晚安 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Good night. Good night, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.75,0:44:42.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,早安 潘德史密斯 早安 邦德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Morning, Pleydell-Smith. Morning, Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.75,0:44:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你 但我需要一些资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to trouble you, but I need some information.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.45,0:44:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,有关诺博士 和克拉布岛的所有资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have on Dr. No and Crab Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.62,0:44:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔罗小姐 拿诺博士的档案来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Taro, bring me the files on Dr. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.99,0:44:54.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下 你对这个岛有什么认识？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down. What do you know about the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.56,0:44:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,认识不多 除了那儿有铝土矿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not much, except there's a bauxite mine there.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.87,0:44:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺博士把那儿 当作集中营般管理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. No runs it like a concentration camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.94,0:45:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听到有趣的传闻 没有人正式投诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've heard funny rumors, but no one's ever complained officially.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.67,0:45:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔罗小姐 放在这儿好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss Taro, just leave them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.74,0:45:09.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 我找不到资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very sorry, but we can't find them anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.78,0:45:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思？谁最后看过它？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean? who had them last?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.58,0:45:14.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个档案都被斯崔奇威拿走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Strangways. Both files.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.82,0:45:16.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Miss Taro.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.22,0:45:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,真讨厌 档案就这么消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn nuisance, their disappearing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.06,0:45:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,相反地\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the contrary.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.63,0:45:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,档案没消失我才感到奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have been surprised if they hadn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.73,0:45:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那包裹用外交邮袋 由伦敦空运抵达\N{\fnArial\fs30}That came for you from London in the plane, in the diplomatic pouch.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.74,0:45:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自家乡的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Present from home.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.61,0:45:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以从那出去吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}can I get out that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.16,0:46:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,顽皮的习惯 从钥匙孔偷听？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a naughty little habit. Listening at keyholes?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.03,0:46:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我只是在寻找档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn'n listening. I was looking for those files.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.30,0:46:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,找不到东西 我总要被责怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that can't be found, I get the blame.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.00,0:46:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 已经不重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. I'm sure it's not very important anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.84,0:46:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想你整个下午在找档案\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate to think you'll spend the afternoon looking for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.31,0:46:17.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这个下午我休假\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I have the afternoon off.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.78,0:46:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真巧合 我也是 你何不带我在这小岛观光？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a coincidence. So have I. Why not show me around the island?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.45,0:46:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,陌生人的邀请 我是否该答应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What should I say to an invitation from a strange gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.96,0:46:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.96,0:46:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should say maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.56,0:46:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许三点来我的饭店？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three o'clock at my hotel, maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.10,0:46:36.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.03,0:46:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.81,0:46:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,发光的罗盘启动它 拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The luminous dial activates it. Hold this.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.15,0:46:57.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威指挥官 将样本放在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did Commander Strangways place those samples?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.32,0:46:59.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约是你站着的位置 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}About where your feet is. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.20,0:47:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 掉了东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi there. Lose something?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.47,0:47:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看盖格指数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look at this Geiger reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.11,0:47:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威从克拉布岛 带回来的样本具放射能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those samples Strangways brought back from Crab Key were radioactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.81,0:47:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,登特却说是一文不值的矿石\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet Dent told me they were worthless chunks of iron ore.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.65,0:47:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是糟透的教授就是说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's either a bad professor or a poor liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.98,0:47:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道他究竟是哪一个 你 最快何时可带我们到克拉布岛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I intend to find out which. How soon can you get us to Crab Key?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.52,0:47:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 情形是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's like this, captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.23,0:47:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯崔奇威指挥官已拿了 各个岛的样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commander Strangways, he done take samples of all the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.56,0:47:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先从最近的 岛屿开始好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposing we check the nearest ones first?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.73,0:47:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我对克拉布岛有兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm interested in Crab Key.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.90,0:47:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾带他到那儿 我们安全离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took the commander there, and we got away without trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.80,0:47:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不应经常测试 一个人的运气\N{\fnArial\fs30}It don't do for a man to tempt providence too often.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.24,0:47:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, there's a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.91,0:47:52.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.51,0:47:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人的传说 可能是诺博士传出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Native superstition. Started by Dr. No, probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.15,0:47:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想逼你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. We don't want to force you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.62,0:48:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你为我们引路 莱特和我会在晚上进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leiter and I will go over after dark if you'll give us directions.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.56,0:48:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我用鼻子、耳朵和第六感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get my directions from my nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.36,0:48:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来辨别方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}my ears, from my instincts.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.03,0:48:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论如何 七点我会到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I'll be here about 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.57,0:48:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.84,0:48:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 你有留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond, there's a telephone message for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.68,0:48:30.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,强尼 你把它放在哪儿？就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Johnny, what have you done with it? It's right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.37,0:48:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.17,0:48:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我在想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Mr.Bond. I was thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.78,0:49:00.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你来我家接我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you collect me at my apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.98,0:49:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的家在山上 很舒适和美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's lovely up here in the mountains. Nice and cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.35,0:49:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你从京士顿的皇室港路走\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. You leave the Port Royal Road out of Kingston.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.39,0:49:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着文特沃思路 直至看到水泥工厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then along the Wentworth Road until you get to the cement factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.60,0:49:18.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you turn left.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.73,0:49:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿路上山 在另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Follow the road up the hill, down the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.77,0:49:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约两里远 在左边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and two miles further on, on the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.14,0:49:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马真塔路2391号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magenta Drive, 2391.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.24,0:49:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.62,0:51:15.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎会发生这种事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did it happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.88,0:51:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们在出席葬礼的路上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they were on their way to a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.08,0:51:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.99,0:51:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,可记得你曾邀请我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did invite me, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.26,0:51:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 只是不知道你这么快就到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I just didn't expect you here so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.06,0:52:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.73,0:52:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先去穿衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go put some clothes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.74,0:52:12.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,别因为我添麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go to any trouble on my account.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.58,0:52:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.15,0:52:18.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 我以为你想我来看景色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. I thought I was invited up here to admire the view.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.79,0:52:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们其中一人该接听电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel one of us should answer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.06,0:52:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我知道 他现在在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Yes, I know. He's here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:42.57,0:52:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道发生什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.61,0:52:49.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我会拖延他几个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll try and keep him here for a couple of hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.68,0:52:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我要挂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right-I'll have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:51.85,0:52:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后再找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I'll call you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.36,0:53:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得出你喜欢过危险的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You believe in living dangerously. I can see that.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.49,0:53:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.46,0:53:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,头发湿透的坐在那儿 你会患上肺炎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sitting around with wet hair, you'll die of pneumonia.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.50,0:53:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,很漂亮 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is rather beautiful. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.30,0:53:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你经常束起头发吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you always wear it up?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.31,0:53:17.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢这样吗？非常喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you like it that way? Very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.27,0:53:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,加上你的样貌 真是美极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your sort of face, it's wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.28,0:53:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的背部怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on behind my back?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.92,0:53:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.25,0:53:31.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 双手在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, no hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.37,0:53:48.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肚子饿 出外吃东西吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry. Let's go out and eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.04,0:53:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来做晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make dinner here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.81,0:53:55.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我想吃意大利菜和听音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I'm feeling Italian and musical.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.05,0:53:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,去蓝山餐厅吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Blue Mountain Grill.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.62,0:53:59.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可留在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.68,0:54:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,独处乐趣更多\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more fun alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.75,0:54:05.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不想你的玉手为我操劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but I don't want you getting dishpan hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.69,0:54:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢烹饪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.42,0:54:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了吧 我可以用你的电话吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it. May I use your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.73,0:54:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打电话给谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you ringing?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.77,0:54:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,计程车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.94,0:54:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是詹姆斯邦德 请派车子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}James Bond here. Can I have a car sent to.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.64,0:54:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,马真塔路2171号\N{\fnArial\fs30}2171 Magenta Drive?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.68,0:54:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,请尽快 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}As soon as you can, please. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.95,0:54:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你开车子来 车子坏了 引擎有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you came by car. Wouldn't start. Engine trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.18,0:54:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这解释了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That explains.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.49,0:54:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,解释了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Explains what?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.25,0:54:39.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你需要计程车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why you need a taxi.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.96,0:54:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何我需要计程车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why I need a taxi?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.39,0:54:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心我的指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful, my nail varnish!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.37,0:54:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用关灯吗？不 我经常开灯\N{\fnArial\fs30}The lights. No, I always leave them on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.91,0:55:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.98,0:55:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,原谅我 督察 拘捕她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me. Book her, superintendent.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.05,0:55:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.35,0:55:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心她的指甲\N{\fnArial\fs30}be careful of her nail varnish.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.67,0:57:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下它 教授 在你背后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it, professor! Behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:43.94,0:57:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你早晚也会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd turn up sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.61,0:57:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.02,0:57:54.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩透露了 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl talked. But of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.89,0:57:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在皇后俱乐部已怀疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was suspicious at the Queens Club anyhow.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.82,0:58:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你见过斯崔奇威的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you were the only one who'd seen Strangways' new secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.10,0:58:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着在实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then at the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.26,0:58:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有提及斯崔奇威的样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}you didn't mention that Strangways' samples.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.14,0:58:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是具放射能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}were radioactive.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.60,0:58:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你非常聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very clever, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.37,0:58:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道要对抗的 力量有多庞大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're up against more than you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.38,0:58:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀死我 你会像斯崔奇威一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot me, you'll end up like Strangways.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.81,0:58:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你杀了他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You killed him?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.38,0:58:22.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已被杀 不管他是怎么死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was killed, but never mind how.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.35,0:58:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为谁工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you working for?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.05,0:58:29.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你 你也用不着这资料 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you. You won't live to use the information. I'm working.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.32,0:58:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是史密斯魏森手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Smith & Wesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.99,0:58:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已开了六发子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you've had your six.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.08,0:58:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟到总好过不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better late than never.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.82,0:58:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切准备好吗？两小时前就已经就绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything ready? For the last two hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.29,0:59:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 一切会很顺利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. Everything will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.62,0:59:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你所愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say so.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.12,0:59:08.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我却有不同的预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottom of where my belly used to be tells me different.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.23,0:59:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为到克拉布岛 是很好的放松\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me, Crab Key's going to be a gentle relaxation.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.40,0:59:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,想远离什么？女人吗？不想再处于挨打位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what? Dames? No, from being a clay pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.97,0:59:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,引擎只可带我们到这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is as far as we go with the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.23,0:59:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在开始要靠风力和浆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make with paddle and wind from now on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.14,0:59:59.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我跟他一起去 不 我们说好了 由我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go with him. No. We settled that. It's my beat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.01,1:00:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已身不由己了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my head in the noose if anything gets unstuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.08,1:00:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡纳维尔角发射火箭 只会延迟四十八小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Canaveral can only wait 48 hours for that moon shot.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.29,1:00:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在十二点回来 若我们不回来 那就由你来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back in 12. If not, it's your beat.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.79,1:00:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好带海军来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better bring your marines with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.96,1:00:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,夸勒尔 若你见到龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quarrel, if you see a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.23,1:00:16.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你先对付他 向他呼气\N{\fnArial\fs30}you get him first and breathe on him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.73,1:00:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喝了这么多甜酒 他会死得很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}With all that rum in you, he'll die happy.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.79,1:00:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,最好放下帆 以免被雷达探测到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better drop the sail in case their radar's on scan.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.31,1:01:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,转向 船长 立刻！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hard about, captain. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.14,1:01:31.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它盖好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.71,1:01:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在天亮前 最好先睡一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd better get some sleep before it gets light.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.31,1:01:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be down this end.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:21.32,1:02:24.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 芒果树下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Underneath the mango tree ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.32,1:02:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 啦-啦 啦-啦 啲 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ La-la la-la dee ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.66,1:02:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 守着月亮 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Come watch for the moon ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.41,1:02:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 啦-啦-哒-哒 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ La-la-da-da ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.66,1:02:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 芒果树下 爱人伴我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Mango tree, me honey and me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.66,1:02:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一起吟唱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Make bu-lu-lup ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.83,1:02:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 芒果树下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Underneath the mango tree… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.59,1:02:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 一起吟唱 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Make bu-lu-lup soon ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.47,1:02:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 啦-啦-啦 啲-哒-哒 爱人伴我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ La-la-la dee-da-da… me honey and me ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.64,1:02:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 芒果树下 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ Underneath the mango tree ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.22,1:02:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,∮ 爱人伴我 ∮\N{\fnArial\fs30}∮ My honey and me… ∮
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.36,1:02:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.47,1:03:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用怕 我不该来这儿 你独自一人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right, I'm not supposed to be here either. Are you alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.47,1:03:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛？找寻贝壳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here? Looking for shells?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.21,1:03:14.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是四处张望\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm just looking.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.38,1:03:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.71,1:03:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应不会偷你的贝壳 我也答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise I won't steal your shells. I promise you won't either.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.69,1:03:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地 我到来的目的很神圣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are! My intentions are strictly honorable.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.38,1:03:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.92,1:03:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞德 全名是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ryder. Ryder what?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.45,1:03:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈妮瑞德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey Ryder.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.55,1:04:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你在笑？没什么 这名字很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's so funny about it? Nothing. It's a very pretty name.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:02.89,1:04:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.26,1:04:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,詹姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}James.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.70,1:04:11.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用小船驶到暗礁吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, did you use your sail all the way up to the reef?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.80,1:04:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我一向如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I always do.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:14.11,1:04:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么他们会知道我们在这儿 他们有雷达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they'll know we're here. They have radar.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.04,1:04:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的船太小了 他们发现不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boat is too small to be noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.01,1:04:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常到这儿拾贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I often come here to get shells.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.71,1:04:25.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始时他们想抓我 但抓不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first they tried to catch me, but they couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.92,1:04:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他们也不介意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I don't think they bother anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.05,1:04:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次他们会\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.32,1:04:33.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理会它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother with those!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.66,1:04:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,别理会？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't bother?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.96,1:04:37.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,很值钱的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they valuable?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.03,1:04:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个在迈阿密可卖得五十元\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one is worth $50 in Miami.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.07,1:04:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,五十元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifty!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.50,1:04:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你答应不会告诉别人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promise you won't tell anyone?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.31,1:04:49.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我答应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I Promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.18,1:04:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快来看看 没问题 他是我的同伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and take a look! It's all right. He's with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.31,1:04:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 你认为怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain, what do you think of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.28,1:05:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.29,1:05:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是高速船只 找掩护 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a high-powered boat. Take some cover. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.39,1:05:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're here, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.43,1:05:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们快出来 这就不会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, folks. Come out and you won't get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.90,1:05:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 表露身分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand up and show yourselves.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.06,1:05:48.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,否则我们会开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}or we'll be forced to open fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.57,1:05:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.00,1:05:56.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你们在这儿 我们一直在等你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know you're there! We've been expecting you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.68,1:05:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,高举双手走出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just walk out with your hands up and you'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.51,1:06:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们的最后机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your last chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.38,1:06:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们只是吹嘘 别伸出头来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bluffing, but keep your head down.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.15,1:06:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 已向你们作出警告\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right! You've been warned!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.89,1:06:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后通牒 别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it! Lie still.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.46,1:06:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会持续很久的 他们不知道我们在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't last long. They don't know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.73,1:06:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.07,1:06:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要出来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You coming out?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.18,1:06:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:32.61,1:06:36.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会带狗回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back! We'll be back with the dogs!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.65,1:06:37.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,全速前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Full speed ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.74,1:07:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早说过这儿有问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you there's something wrong here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.38,1:07:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是机枪 不是龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a machine gun, not a dragon.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.51,1:07:06.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿也有龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a dragon here too.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:06.88,1:07:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对 你曾见过他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right. You've seen it?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:09.12,1:07:12.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见过 他有两个头 眼睛火红\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I have. He had two great, glaring eyes.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.75,1:07:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,尾子短短 还有翅膀\N{\fnArial\fs30}short tail and pointed wings.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.85,1:07:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会喷火 你不相信我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was breathing fire. You don't believe me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.46,1:07:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,小女孩 我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Little gal, I does.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.56,1:07:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生 我们快离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, Mr. Bond. Let's get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.13,1:07:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 根本没有龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, both of you. There are no such things as dragons.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.63,1:07:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见的只是像龙的物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you saw was something that looked like one.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.17,1:07:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在想他是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to think what it was.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.27,1:07:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你如何知道那不是龙？你对动物有多少认识？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know there aren't? What do you know about animals?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.18,1:07:38.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾见过鼬跳舞吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you ever see a mongoose dance.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.21,1:07:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者蝎子因为中暑而刺死自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a scorpion with sunstroke sting itself to death.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.65,1:07:44.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者螳螂在做爱后吃掉丈夫？\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a praying mantis eat her husband after making love?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.05,1:07:47.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想承认 但我不曾见过 我见过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate to admit it, but I haven't. Well, I have.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.92,1:07:49.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.06,1:07:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们走了 哈妮 你也要离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've gone. Honey, you're getting out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.33,1:07:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了自会离开 绝不是在白天离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get out when I'm ready, and that's never in daylight.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.53,1:07:59.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次你是 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time you are, and fast.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.80,1:08:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的船在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your boat?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.74,1:08:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿我的鞋子来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fetch my shoes.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.21,1:08:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他们干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what they've done!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.52,1:08:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all your fault!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.02,1:08:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 回到京士顿 我会买一艘新船给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'll get you a new boat when we get back to Kingston.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.59,1:08:24.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎处置她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do with her now?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.73,1:08:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你不介意 我知道一个藏身地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you like, I know a good place where we can hide.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.93,1:08:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个开始 留下不需要的东西 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}That'll do for a start. Leave what you don't need. Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.87,1:08:33.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.86,1:09:01.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们定要走这条路吗？这不会留下气味让狗追踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must we come this way? It throws the dogs off the scent.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.77,1:09:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶的蚊子！用水涂遍全身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn mosquitos! Rub water all over yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.30,1:09:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想吃芉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the salt they're after.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.51,1:09:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 他们来了 在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! They's coming! Across there!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.38,1:09:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,割下一些芦苇 把刀子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut some of those reeds! Give me the knife.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.19,1:09:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,去那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.60,1:09:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们更接近了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming closer.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.34,1:09:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,安静 有东西咬我的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet! Something's biting my foot!
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.44,1:09:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你乱动 他们就会知道 我们在这 潜下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you disturb the mud, they'll know we're here. Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.60,1:10:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们好像有所发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look like they're onto something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.52,1:10:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,潜下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down. Get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.69,1:11:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？我一定要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? Because I had to.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.59,1:11:43.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙很在行 我们躲过 其他人 他还跟踪我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy knew his business, trailing us after we'd let the others pass.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.53,1:11:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快离开这儿 你说的藏身处在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here. Where's your hiding place?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.16,1:11:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,在上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.84,1:11:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.90,1:11:59.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险 不准进入）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.04,1:12:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经不那么臭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell nicer already.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:05.21,1:12:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.38,1:12:09.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Bond! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.02,1:12:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎样？看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}What now? Look!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.96,1:12:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是龙的痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are dragon tracks.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.79,1:12:23.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 这是他呼吸过的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look! That's where he breathed!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.93,1:12:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,若你想休息就休息一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ought to get some rest if you want to.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.50,1:12:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我留在这儿观察 他闻到我们的气味就会到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I stay out here and watch in case he smells us and comes looking for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.41,1:12:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我跟你轮流\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I'll take the second watch.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.04,1:12:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在午夜就会离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be out of here by midnight.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.35,1:12:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从不曾认识任何侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never met a detective before.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.38,1:12:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会拘捕诺博士吗？有人会拘捕他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to arrest Dr. No? Someone is.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.99,1:12:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可让他杀死任何来这儿的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have him trying to kill everyone who comes here.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.56,1:12:53.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不只尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't just try.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.13,1:12:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定他杀死了我的父亲 这是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm pretty sure he killed my father. What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.90,1:13:01.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的父亲是海洋生物学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, my father was a marine zoologist.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.97,1:13:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来到加勒比海 好让他研究贝壳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We came to the Caribbean for him to study seashells.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.44,1:13:09.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去了克拉布岛后 我不曾再见他\N{\fnArial\fs30}One day, he came to Crab Key, and I never saw him again.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.61,1:13:12.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说他一定是溺毙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said he must have drowned.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.02,1:13:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他是出色的潜水员 不会发生这种事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was too good a diver for that to happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.15,1:13:18.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方没有调查吗？你的家人又怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't the police investigate? What about your family?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.99,1:13:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们调查了很长时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They investigated for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.99,1:13:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着说他失踪了 假设死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then they said, "Missing, presumed dead."
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.66,1:13:27.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有其他家人 只有父亲和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't any family. There was only my father and me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.20,1:13:29.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你单独一人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here alone?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.97,1:13:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来此前你住在哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you live before you came here?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.17,1:13:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界各地\N{\fnArial\fs30}All over the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:34.40,1:13:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,菲律宝、巴厘岛、夏威夷 只要是有贝壳的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Philippines, Bali, Hawaii. About anywhere there were shells.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.47,1:13:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定念过书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to school somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.48,1:13:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不用上学 我们有百科全书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't need to. We had an encyclopedia.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.55,1:13:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,八岁时我从A开始学习 现在已学到T了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I started at "A" when I was 8, and now I've reached "T".
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.48,1:13:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂的事肯定比你多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I know a lot more things than you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.72,1:13:54.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,在京士顿的有人帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't anyone in Kingston help?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.79,1:13:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前居住的地方的房东\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there was this man who owned the place where we were living.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:59.83,1:14:02.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我不用付钱留宿一段日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He let me stay on for a while without paying.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.13,1:14:05.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,接着有一晚他进入我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then one night, he came up to my room.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.97,1:14:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.97,1:14:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄伤他的脸 接着 他比我壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I scratched his face, and then But he was stronger than I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.61,1:14:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.58,1:14:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将黑寡妇蜘蛛 放在他的蚊帐内\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put a black widow spider underneath his mosquito net.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.02,1:14:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,雌性的 他们最厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}A female, and they're the worst.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.42,1:14:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,过了一个礼拜他才死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It took him a whole week to die.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.86,1:14:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做错了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I do wrong?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.30,1:14:35.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要不成为习惯就可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wouldn't do to make a habit of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.80,1:14:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有女朋友吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have a woman of your own?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.67,1:14:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quick! Down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.64,1:14:49.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论是什么 正朝着这儿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever's coming, it's coming this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.68,1:14:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次我想亲眼看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, I want to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.28,1:14:55.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 还剩下不到十二小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And hurry! There's less than 12 hours to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.04,1:15:23.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地 全部的人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay where you are! All of you!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.98,1:15:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,留在原地！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.76,1:15:39.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,船长 若这不是龙是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, captain. If that ain't a dragon, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.73,1:15:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,由柴油引擎推动的龙 忘了鬼神之说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A dragon that runs on diesel engines. Forget the spooks.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.97,1:15:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,它驶近时 打那司机 我负责车前灯和车胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's closer, take the driver. I'll take the headlights and the tires.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.70,1:15:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留在安全的地方 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You keep safe out of sight. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.48,1:16:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说留在那儿 我很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said to stay there. I was frightened.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.81,1:16:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then get down.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.63,1:16:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.60,1:16:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快出来 将手放在我看到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on out! Hands where we can see them!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.37,1:16:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有那女孩 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the dame! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:51.80,1:16:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你想再挨一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless you want an extra navel.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.71,1:16:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 丢下手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it. Drop that gun.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:00.41,1:17:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手枪踢过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kick it away from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.52,1:17:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,女孩留在原地 走向我 手放在前面\N{\fnArial\fs30}The girl will stay where she is. Walk towards me, hands out in front.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.73,1:17:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 你想去哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Hey, you! Where do you think you're going?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:25.77,1:17:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我们没有花 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry we ain't got any flowers. Come on, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.21,1:17:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.38,1:17:38.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,把刀子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me that knife!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.90,1:17:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,放过他 别挡路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone! Get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.05,1:18:14.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来 小心看着那个男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside! Keep an eye on the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.16,1:18:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 他们曾去沼泽 可能被污染\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful. They've been in the swamp and they're contaminated.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.53,1:18:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查盖格指数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check that Geiger reading.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.57,1:18:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的指数是95 她是88\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's reading 95, chief. She's 88.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.24,1:18:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,污染数字太高了 快替他们刷干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too much for the monitors. Scrub them down but quick!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.06,1:18:53.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.17,1:19:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,指数是72点8 泥土渗进了他们的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading 72.8. The mud's soaked into their clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.61,1:19:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 脱去他们的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Take off all their clothes.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.08,1:19:09.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'll he do?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.58,1:19:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们感染了放射能\N{\fnArial\fs30}We picked up radioactive contamination.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.85,1:19:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,先清洁那女孩 我们来下命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do the girl first. We give the orders here!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.88,1:19:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 但想想办法 你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, but do something about this. Come here, you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.42,1:19:20.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.59,1:19:23.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用高温高压射口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use the higt-temperature jets. Full pressure.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.87,1:19:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的指数是47 好的 到那男的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's reading 47. All right. Put the man through.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.44,1:19:42.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的指数是40\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's now clocking 40.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.31,1:19:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,仍然很高\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is still high.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.81,1:19:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,指数38\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reading 38.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.59,1:19:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,下跌到八 那女孩别动 第三阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down to eight. Hold the girl. Stage three.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.59,1:19:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的指数是18\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's now 18.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.66,1:20:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在是八\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's now at eight.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.63,1:20:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上是零 她没问题了 好 叫他准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Practically zero. She's clear. Good. Get the man ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.34,1:20:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的指数是四\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got a count of four.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.51,1:20:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查他的指甲 把手放出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check his fingernails. Put your hands in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.88,1:20:25.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没问题 我会通知接待处他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's okay. I'll notify reception they're coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.39,1:20:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,已清除污染物 他们正在进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Decontamination here. They're coming through now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.49,1:20:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come in. Come in.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.59,1:21:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怜的人 我们不知道你们何时会到来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You poor dears. We simply didn't know when to expect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.56,1:21:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来以为是昨午茶时间 接着是晚餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}First, it was teatime yesterday, then dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.57,1:21:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在半小时前 我们才知道你要来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was only a half-hour ago we knew you were on your way.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.73,1:21:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抽烟吗？有美式的、英式的 和土耳其式的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cigarette? There's American, English and Turkish.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.61,1:21:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是罗丝姐妹 这是莉莉姐妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sister Rose. This is Sister Lily.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.91,1:21:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是来侍奉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here to make your stay plaesant.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.28,1:21:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很感谢你 但 你会想去看看房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of you, but You'll be wanting to see your rooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.78,1:21:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,早餐在准备中 然后你们会睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Breakfast is already ordered and then you'll want to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.96,1:21:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,博士下令在今晚前 不能打扰你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The doctor left orders you're not to be disturbed until tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:36.73,1:21:40.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一起晚膳他会很高兴 我该怎样告诉他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd be delighted if you'd join him for dinner. Shall I say you'll be there?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:40.56,1:21:42.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他我深感荣幸 好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell him I'll also be delighted. Splendid.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:43.13,1:21:45.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他会很高兴 到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he'll be pleased. Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.61,1:21:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}This will be your room, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.21,1:21:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的浴室\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your bathroom in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:55.51,1:21:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for you, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.31,1:22:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is your room.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.09,1:22:05.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这儿有洁净的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll find fresh clothes in here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.29,1:22:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望会合身\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they fit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.29,1:22:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为至昨晚才知道 你衣服的尺寸大小\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't get your sizes till last night.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.93,1:22:16.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要什么请告诉我们 随便什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ring if there's anything else you want. Anything at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.23,1:22:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,例如两张到伦敦的机票？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such as two air tickets to London?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.84,1:22:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我让你们好好休息吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll leave you two dear people in peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.89,1:22:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃早餐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's have some breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.62,1:22:42.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这时候你还有心情吃早餐？因为我很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you eat at a time like this? Because I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.09,1:22:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道 何时再有机会吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know when we'll get a chance to eat again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.93,1:22:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,来 拿去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here. Take this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.60,1:22:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心 这儿可能有窃听装置\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. The whole place is probably wired for sound.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.21,1:23:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.98,1:23:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知不知道 他们会怎么对待我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you any idea what they'll do with us?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.69,1:23:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.32,1:23:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有门锁或窗户\N{\fnArial\fs30}No door handles or windows either.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.89,1:23:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是监狱 豪华设备、一级服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a prison, then. Mink-lined, with first-class service.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:24.50,1:23:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.57,1:23:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't feel so good.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.71,1:23:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,很想睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel so sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.31,1:23:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,可恶的咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn coffee!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.66,1:24:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.96,1:24:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很想睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleepy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.07,1:25:03.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么让我们昏睡的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What made us pass out like that?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.27,1:25:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡内下了药\N{\fnArial\fs30}The coffee was drugged.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.01,1:25:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该吃晚餐了 我们不想博士等候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for dinner. We don't want to keep the doctor waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.25,1:25:16.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用久等 准备好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would never do. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.65,1:25:20.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose so.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.26,1:25:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表现很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.90,1:25:32.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.13,1:25:36.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的衣着合适吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I properly dressed for the occasion?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.44,1:25:39.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,很合适 适合什么样的场合？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quite suitable. Suitable for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.05,1:25:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.56,1:25:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你的手也会流汗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad your hands are sweating too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.06,1:26:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我也感到害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course. I'm scared too.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.10,1:26:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,自然一点 由我跟他说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}So be natural, and leave all the talking to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.17,1:26:07.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.20,1:26:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你们好好享受\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you enjoy your dinner.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.29,1:27:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come and look.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.70,1:27:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,人工灯光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Artificial light.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.61,1:27:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可能在数百尺的海底下\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could be hundreds of feet beneath the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.98,1:27:25.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种海洋郁金香 只能在二百尺以下存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that. Sea tulips. They do not grow above 200 feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:25.28,1:27:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百万元 邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}One million dollars, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.88,1:27:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想它的价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wondering what it cost.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.52,1:27:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上我确是这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}As a matter of fact, I was.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.86,1:27:44.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我不跟你们握手 我的手遇上不幸事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive my not shaking hands. It's awkward with these. A misfortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.77,1:27:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在欣赏我的水族馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were admiring my aquarium.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:48.67,1:27:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 真让人印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's quite impressive.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.97,1:27:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,独特的科学技术 我亲自设计的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A unique feat of engineering. I designed it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.88,1:27:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,凸透镜 十寸厚 有放大作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Convex glass, 10 inches thick, which accounts for the magnifying effect.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.45,1:28:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲤科小鱼假扮成鲸鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Minnows pretending they're whales.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.65,1:28:04.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你在这岛上一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like you on this island, Dr. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:04.65,1:28:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,这看你是在玻璃的哪一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It depends, Mr. Bond, on which side of the glass you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.93,1:28:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一杯马丁尼加柠檬皮 用摇的 没有搅拌\N{\fnArial\fs30}A medium-dry martini, lemon peel. Shaken, not stirred.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.56,1:28:15.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,有伏特加吗？当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vodka? Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.63,1:28:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很快就要吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have dinner at once.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.50,1:28:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,有太多事要讨论 时间又太少\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's so much to discuss, so little time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.60,1:28:48.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺博士 你干得不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Dr. No, you haven't done badly, considering.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.93,1:28:50.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,命运是自己造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}A handicap is what you make of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.13,1:28:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是一个德国教士 和一个中国的大家闺秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the unwanted child of a German missionary.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.14,1:28:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,的弃婴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and a Chinese firl of good family.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.61,1:29:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我成为中国 最庞大黑帮的会计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet I became treasurer of the most powerful criminal society in China.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.51,1:29:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国人相信混血儿是很少有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's rare for the tongs to trust anyone who isn't completely Chinses.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.38,1:29:08.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I doubt they should do so again.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.79,1:29:12.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偷了他们一千万黄金 逃到美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I escaped to America with 10 million of their dollars in gold.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.52,1:29:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你有钱兴建这个工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how you financed this operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.49,1:29:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,使用核能是一个好主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a good idea to use atomic power.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.86,1:29:19.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,很高兴你处理得宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you can handle it properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.80,1:29:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那清除放射能污染设备 真的不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd hate to think your decontamination chamber wasn't effective.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.74,1:29:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作使我对放射能有深入了解\N{\fnArial\fs30}My work has given me a unique knowledge of radioactivity.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.21,1:29:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我也得付出代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not without costs, as you see.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.88,1:29:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的权力来源使我方充满疑团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your power source had our organization puzzled for some time.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.35,1:29:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们仍很迷惘\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are still puzzled.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.55,1:29:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了 我已寄出了报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not any longer. I sent a complete report.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.02,1:29:50.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从要求送盖格仪器来后 你没有与总部联络\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've not contacted headquarters since you requested a Geiger counter.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.13,1:29:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经有很多人在调查你\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are so many files open on you already.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.93,1:29:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们、中央情报局\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our own, the CIA's.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.00,1:30:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你偷去金钱的中国黑帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}the one from the tong society that you robbed.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:01.24,1:30:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,当麻烦到来时 你会发现 这儿是个小及贫乏的小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}When trouble comes, you'll find this is a very small and naked island.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.21,1:30:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个可牺牲的小岛\N{\fnArial\fs30}An expendable little island.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.68,1:30:11.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我在克拉布岛的任务完成 我会毁灭这小岛并离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my mission in Crab Key is done, I destroy it and move on.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.68,1:30:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但求知欲不会减退\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the habit of inquiry is persistent.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:13.75,1:30:15.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在想为什么？哪儿？何时？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see you're wondering why, where, when.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.92,1:30:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我满足你的好奇心 因为你是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only gratify your curiosity because you're the one man I've met.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.46,1:30:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一欣赏我所作所为的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}capable of appreciating what I've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.79,1:30:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且没有向他人透露\N{\fnArial\fs30}and keeping it to himself.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.06,1:30:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.80,1:30:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,此事与这女孩无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}No point in involving the girl. She has nothing to do with us.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:32.37,1:30:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,让她离开 她答应不会透露半句\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her go free. She'll promise not to talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.07,1:30:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要留下 我不想你在此\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm staying with you. I don't want you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.98,1:30:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我同意这女孩与此事无关 带她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I agree this is no place for the girl. Take her away.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.32,1:30:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定守卫会使她大开眼界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the guards will amuse her.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.59,1:30:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.16,1:30:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是55年的香槟 打破它太可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a Dom Perignon '55. It would be a pity to break it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.53,1:31:03.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我较喜欢53年的香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}I prefer the '53 myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.94,1:31:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,笨手笨脚 你让我失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clumsy effort. You disappoint me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.64,1:31:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是傻子 所以别当我是傻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not a fool, so please don't treat me as one.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.01,1:31:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,将刀子放回原位\N{\fnArial\fs30}That table knife, please put it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.75,1:31:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不可能全都是天才 对吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't all be geniuses, can we?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.69,1:31:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,使美国飞弹失准真的能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me, does toppling American missiles.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.16,1:31:26.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,补偿你失去双手之苦吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}really compensate for having no hands?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.76,1:31:30.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是证明我们实力的第一步\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missiles are only the first step to prove our power.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.63,1:31:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Our power?"
Dialogue: 0,1:31:32.46,1:31:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你丝毫不尊重生命 你该为东方人工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}With your disregard for human life, you must be working for the East.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.70,1:31:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,东、西 那是指南针上的指标 两者也是蠢才\N{\fnArial\fs30}East, West. Points of the compass, each as stupid as the other.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:39.61,1:31:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是特别执行组织的成员 特别执行组织？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a member of SPECTRE. SPECTRE?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.44,1:31:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,反情报、反恐怖主义、反复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}SPECTRE:"Special Executive for Counterintelligence.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.11,1:31:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,反勒索特别执行组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}Terrorism, Revenge, Extortion."
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.01,1:31:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,权力的四大基石\N{\fnArial\fs30}The four great cornerstones of power.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:51.28,1:31:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是由全球最具智慧的人操控\N{\fnArial\fs30}headed by the world's greatest brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.59,1:31:56.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,更正 是具犯罪智慧的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Correction. Criminal brains.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.22,1:32:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功的罪犯总是胜人一筹 一定要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The successful criminal brain is always superior. It has to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.36,1:32:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何成为罪犯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why become criminal?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.39,1:32:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我肯定西方 会欢迎你这种科学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sure the West would welcome a scientist of your caliber.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.30,1:32:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人是蠢才 我提出帮忙 他们却拒绝了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans are fools. I offered my services, they refused.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.80,1:32:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,东方人也是 现在他们要为犯错付上代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}So did the East. Now they can both pay for their mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.68,1:32:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制全球 同样的旧梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}World domination. That same old dream.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.68,1:32:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神病院内充满自以为是 拿破仑或神的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our asylums are full of people who think they're Napoleon or God.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.22,1:32:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直想激怒我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You persist in trying to provoke me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.59,1:32:35.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本可在沼泽杀死你 为何不动手呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could've had you killed in the swamp. Why didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:37.03,1:32:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你不会那么愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you less stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.30,1:32:42.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,通常阻碍我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Usually when a man gets in my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.54,1:32:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你很不同 你花费我的时间 金钱和努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were different. You cost me time, money, effort.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.08,1:32:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打击了我的组织和我的自尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You damaged my organization and my pride.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.42,1:32:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很好奇想知道你是怎样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was curious to see what kind of man you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:56.68,1:32:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,在组织内 可能有职位适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought there might be a place for you at SPECTRE.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.25,1:33:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过奖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm flattered.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.32,1:33:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢进复仇部门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd prefer the revenge department.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.36,1:33:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的首要任务是找出 杀死斯崔奇威和夸勒尔的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My first job would be finding the man who killed Strangways and Quarrel.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:10.87,1:33:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不幸地 我对你判断错误 你只是愚蠢的警员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unfortunately, I misjudged you. You are just a stupid policeman.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:18.57,1:33:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且运气快用完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}whose luck has run out.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.94,1:33:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,诺博士 他们在控制室等候你\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're waiting for you in the control room, Dr. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.78,1:33:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用急 他们还没开始倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}No hurry. They won't have started their countdown check yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.55,1:33:31.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这次不可逃脱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't get away with it this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:31.89,1:33:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,美国人已准备好 会面对任何难题\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Americans are prepared for any trouble.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.82,1:33:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来不会失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never fail, Mr. Bond.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.03,1:33:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们怎对待他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we do with him?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:41.03,1:33:44.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好教训他 我还有话跟他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soften him up. I haven't finished with him yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.68,1:39:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已放入新的燃料吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you got new fuel elements loaded?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:27.81,1:39:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All ready, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:31.95,1:39:35.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,路障在三千尺外\N{\fnArial\fs30}The roadblock is 3000 feet away.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:35.45,1:39:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有在该区的人后退 不准车子驶入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone in that area's pulled back. No traffic allowed.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:39.49,1:39:41.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射区现已很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}The launch area is cleared for safety.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.06,1:39:44.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一可进入这区的 是防御房的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only personnel within the area are the crew.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:44.97,1:39:47.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作人员和测试人员\N{\fnArial\fs30}inside the blockhouse and the test counter.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:48.03,1:39:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,警号没有指示 但已接近倒数时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alarm hasn't been given, but the time must be near the count.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.51,1:39:55.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭的重量达二百四十顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vehicle is now at its full weight of 240 tons.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.11,1:39:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,全自动电晶体已安装在火箭内\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all automatic transistors have been put on the vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.75,1:40:02.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会启动一半能量三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will run up to half-power for 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.19,1:40:08.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制连结解开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control interlocks free.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.46,1:40:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料12点5\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel elements, 12.5.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.41,1:40:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制方面怎样？控制杆在运作中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control? Control rod actuators operating.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:34.65,1:40:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,核心温度113\N{\fnArial\fs30}Core temperature, 113.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.49,1:40:40.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,变压器？变压器准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Converters? Converters standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:40.25,1:40:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,点燃计已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ignition meters on.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.52,1:40:47.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,放射能量？指数121、141、109\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radiation? Counters 121, 141, 109.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.60,1:40:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,能量稳定器？能量维持在八十万瓦特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Energy stabilizers? Energy steady at 0.8 megawatts.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.80,1:40:56.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,水星控制号已装上追踪系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}system of tracking stations are plugged into Mercury Control.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:56.37,1:40:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel elements?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:59.07,1:41:02.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,燃料 张在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel elements! Where's Chang?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.91,1:41:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,张 你在干什么？快到构籓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chang! What are you doing? Get on the gantry!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.98,1:41:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.96,1:41:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭 关闭反应堆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut down. Shut down reactors!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:20.36,1:41:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要决定作第二次尝试 或者决定放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where control should make a second go or no-go decision.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:28.74,1:41:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是水星控制号 关闭反应堆的倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mercury Control. The countdown for the.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:32.94,1:41:35.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,温度227 正在下降\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reactor shutdown, temperature 227, falling.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.24,1:41:38.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉变压器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Converters off. Converters off.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:39.12,1:41:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,放射能指数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radiation reading.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:40.62,1:41:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,放射能是零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radiation zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:43.32,1:41:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,关闭程序完成了 反应堆安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shutdown procedure complete. Reactor safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:48.99,1:41:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备 我们会留在太空船控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by. We'll stay on spacecraft control.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:52.16,1:41:53.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,作最后倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}for final countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.73,1:41:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是水星控制号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mercury Control.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:55.96,1:41:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查显示器 所有系统也没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check indicates all systems are go at this time.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:00.77,1:42:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数时间是四分三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}The countdown is now four minutes, 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:05.17,1:42:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.58,1:42:09.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（危险程度）
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.35,1:42:11.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是水星控制号\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Mercury Control.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.08,1:42:14.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,太空船机师、发射台\N{\fnArial\fs30}The spacecraft pilot, the launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:14.92,1:42:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧急小组的追踪队员\N{\fnArial\fs30}the tracking crew in case of emergency.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.39,1:42:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至气象员也说可以发射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and even the weatherman, have given us the word "go".
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.52,1:42:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续准备 大约两分钟后发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remain on standby. Approximately two minutes to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.46,1:42:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制杆已准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control rod actuators standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:28.30,1:42:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,变压器已准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Converters standing by.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:31.30,1:42:33.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整电波准备作干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Synchronize radio beam for toppling.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.30,1:42:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,调整电波准备作干扰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Synchronizing radio beam for toppling.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.19,1:42:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,干扰电波已经调节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio beam synchronized for toppling.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.92,1:42:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在指数是零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zero in your mark now.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.59,1:42:59.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们留在水星控制号 作最后倒数\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will stay on Mercury Control for final countdown.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:00.20,1:43:02.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:02.27,1:43:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,用尽全力 燃料21\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run to full power. Fuel elements, 21.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.64,1:43:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,各部门注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, all controls.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:08.11,1:43:10.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在进入发射阶段\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going into operation now.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:10.67,1:43:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,已下了决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control has been made.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:13.81,1:43:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,脐带式管苐已收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}The umbilical is retracted.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.65,1:43:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切运作正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All elements of progress and operation are in good condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:20.98,1:43:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以发射火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the flight.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:22.42,1:43:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒数进入T19秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are in T-minus 19 seconds and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.46,1:43:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,T15秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus 15 and counting.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:38.74,1:43:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,十、九\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten, nine…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:41.44,1:43:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,八、七\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight, seven.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:45.01,1:43:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆子 住手！关上它！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop, you fools! Shut down!
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.28,1:43:50.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,二、一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, one…
Dialogue: 0,1:43:51.35,1:43:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,零\N{\fnArial\fs30}zero.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:53.78,1:43:55.81,Note,0,0,0,0,,（撤离此区）
Dialogue: 0,1:43:55.99,1:43:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danger.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.52,1:44:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blast off!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.64,1:44:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,已抛下高塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}The tower has been jettisoned.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.41,1:44:53.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭在灰色的天空中 真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the rocked against that gray sky, and it's green!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:53.34,1:44:56.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以看到火箭的外形 引擎在运作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can see the outline of the rocket. The engines are burning.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:56.98,1:45:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可听到那声音 很真实的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can hear that the roar still sounds good and true.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:00.42,1:45:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,已到了第四个舱 非常热的火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's above the fourth tank. It's a very hot rocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:04.62,1:45:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以看到蔚蓝空中有火焰\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see the flame of it coming into clear, blue sky.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.39,1:45:11.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始闪闪发光\N{\fnArial\fs30}up in the sunlight, beginning to gleam.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.20,1:45:13.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好 稳定的攀升\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good, steady climb.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:14.10,1:45:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有系统也正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All systems go!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:32.02,1:45:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honey! Honey!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.80,1:45:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起来的女孩在哪？我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the girl I came in with? I don't know!
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.41,1:45:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我一起来的女孩在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the girl they brought in with me?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.94,1:46:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,十二号房 带我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Number 12. Show me!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.28,1:47:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有燃料了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've run out of fuel.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:41.28,1:47:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are we going to do now?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:43.35,1:47:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以游泳或\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we can swim or.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:46.45,1:47:47.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,或什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:47.85,1:47:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:03.34,1:48:05.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,邦德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahoy, Mr. Bond! Ahoy, Mr. Bond!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:07.71,1:48:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？你需要帮忙吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well! What's the matter? Do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.81,1:48:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我颇肯定你不需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm quite sure you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.68,1:48:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,既然你来了 请帮我们一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now that you're here, give us a tow.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:18.39,1:48:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,将绳子抛过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw us your line.
